"p "Some inline HTML: a line" raw("<br>") "break, H" raw("<sub>") "2" raw("</sub>") "O, x" raw("<sup>") "2" raw("</sup>") ", and" <NL> raw("<mark>") "highlighted" raw("</mark>") " text with " raw("<span style=\\"color:red\\">") "a span" raw("</span>") "."
